      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    house_price = 300000\n    down_payment = 60000\n    annual_interest_rate = 0.045\n    loan_term_years = 30\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    principal = house_price - down_payment\n    monthly_interest_rate = annual_interest_rate / 12\n    total_payments = loan_term_years * 12\n    monthly_payment = (\n        principal * monthly_interest_rate\n        / (1 - (1 + monthly_interest_rate) ** -total_payments)\n    )\n    answer = round(monthly_payment)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
